                                "text": "W 1930 roku na tron etiopski wstąpił chlubiący się biblijnymi przodkami Ras Tafari Makonnen, który zmienił imię na Hajle Selassje I. Cesarz stał się więc czymś w rodzaju jamajskiego mesjasza"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "640dc59c-cbd2-4af6-8817-fadea354dfff",
                        "source_entry_id": "11013a6b-fba6-3db8-aacb-bda304b707ea",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce2ca607-4a24-3984-94de-2f2a9d7567f9",
                        "target_lang_word": "messiah",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "messiah",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23609d07-d8c1-39e8-863d-05c8ca6c2de9",
                                        "entry_id": "44278e63-4536-3f86-9d69-fb36e4d8225f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The one who is ordained by God to lead the people of Israel, believed by Christians and Muslims to be Jesus Christ."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50912b70-8667-3a1d-9511-798d6ba021f8",
                                        "entry_id": "44278e63-4536-3f86-9d69-fb36e4d8225f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A similar religious figure or awaited divine ruler, such as the Islamic Mahdi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45e5a78d-691a-4376-b772-c18b343d9386",
                                                "sense_id": "50912b70-8667-3a1d-9511-798d6ba021f8",
                                                "text": "The spice exists on only one planet in the entire universe- a desolate, dry planet with vast deserts. Hidden away within the rocks of these deserts are a people known as the Fremen, who have long held a prophecy, that a man would come, a messiah, who would lead them to true freedom. The planet is Arrakis, also known as Dune."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "95baeff9-eb81-35de-8904-af3c2f7f8947",
                                        "entry_id": "44278e63-4536-3f86-9d69-fb36e4d8225f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An extremely powerful or revered figure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "568fbe06-7f63-4ba9-a16f-2a2d8accc16a",
                                                "sense_id": "95baeff9-eb81-35de-8904-af3c2f7f8947",
                                                "text": "At its best, psychoanalysis is the classic therapeutic technique for exploring unconscious processes. At its less-than-best, it is a jargon-opacified oedipus-complicated, libido-theoretical, pseudo-scientific cult whose messiah is Sigmund Freud."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1462f51-ab15-48d0-9881-da7e8b9d0dd7",
                                                "sense_id": "95baeff9-eb81-35de-8904-af3c2f7f8947",
                                                "text": "Girlie, as far as you're concerned, I'm the messiah of the DMV. Now, get out of the car."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5547ad50-053e-4777-a69f-eb77d63d3443",
                        "source_entry_id": "11013a6b-fba6-3db8-aacb-bda304b707ea",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce2ca607-4a24-3984-94de-2f2a9d7567f9",
                        "target_lang_word": "mesiáš",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mesiáš",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aab3363d-06de-3390-8216-b4f663eb27f6",
                                        "entry_id": "aeb7117b-bb08-3ed1-8e9a-a98fa8abbada",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "spasitel, vykupitel"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38f49479-ae02-4488-9aba-fa7747d13eda",
                                                "sense_id": "aab3363d-06de-3390-8216-b4f663eb27f6",
                                                "text": "Přišel večer v onu dobu svatou, v které zrozen světa mesiáš, aby ďábla potřel svojí patou v šťastnější a lepší život náš."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0304de17-1c10-4a76-91fa-e30649efa685",
                        "source_entry_id": "11013a6b-fba6-3db8-aacb-bda304b707ea",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce2ca607-4a24-3984-94de-2f2a9d7567f9",
                        "target_lang_word": "messie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "messie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7137d22-8f56-3e25-9b4d-c005b44c141d",
                                        "entry_id": "3e2e7f81-e2c6-35ad-b4a9-9a638368d527",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Libérateur promis par Dieu dans l’Ancien Testament (pour les chrétiens, il s'agit du Christ)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf7c8d74-fc06-42f3-aa6b-166752e77afc",
                                                "sense_id": "e7137d22-8f56-3e25-9b4d-c005b44c141d",
                                                "text": "Les messies pullulaient en Galilée. Il ne se passait pas six mois sans qu'il en apparaisse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b090c08-de86-449b-91e0-7970978e2625",
                                                "sense_id": "e7137d22-8f56-3e25-9b4d-c005b44c141d",
                                                "text": "Un messie tombe-t-il malade ? Un messie succombe-t-il à une fièvre ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "883aeb87-deed-30d8-969a-3a098b4c0744",
                                        "entry_id": "3e2e7f81-e2c6-35ad-b4a9-9a638368d527",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sauveur d'un peuple ou de l'humanité toute entière."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b89017-0bca-4e6c-a326-3ff75dd55528",
                                                "sense_id": "883aeb87-deed-30d8-969a-3a098b4c0744",
                                                "text": "Plutôt être un exterminateur qu’un messie — Un individu persuadé d’incarner le messianisme en bavera des ronds de chapeau pour mener à bien la tâche qui l’attend : sauver l’humanité... de rien d’autre que d’elle-même."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd960bf4-f380-4978-a3b0-151e56ad3d28",
                                                "sense_id": "883aeb87-deed-30d8-969a-3a098b4c0744",
                                                "text": "Nous voilà maintenant envoûtés par de grands entrepreneurs métamorphosés en messies du public."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
